<h4>Which apps open the result?</h4>
<p>It is a standard .docx file, so Microsoft Word, Apple Pages, LibreOffice and Google Docs all open it.</p>
<h4>Is my PDF uploaded anywhere?</h4>
<p>No. The text is extracted inside your browser tab and the .docx is built on your device.</p>
<h4>Can I convert a password-protected PDF?</h4>
<p>Remove the password first with the Unlock PDF tool, then convert the unlocked copy.</p>
