<h4>Can I convert an old .doc file?</h4>
<p>Save it as .docx in Word or LibreOffice first — the legacy binary .doc format is not supported.</p>
<h4>Is my document uploaded to a server?</h4>
<p>No. The .docx is read and rendered inside your browser tab.</p>
<h4>What page size does the PDF use?</h4>
<p>Text is laid out on A4 pages with standard margins and line spacing.</p>
<h4>How do I add a scanned certificate to the PDF?</h4>
<p>Convert the scan or photo with Image to PDF, then combine both files using Merge PDF.</p>
